⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000012⟫comparable⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000013⟫ is a useful constraint that makes it possible to use the ⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000014⟫==⟪GTI18N_01a04510_000015⟫ and
